  <item>
    <title>串台 x 不方时间 | 漫长的就业季：这年头找一份好工作有多难（鸡汤版）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/654355e7d1844a84f27fc578</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">654355e7d1844a84f27fc578</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 02 Nov 2023 07:55:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目我们又和友台</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5eb53d4d418a84a046a1599b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5eb53d4d418a84a046a1599b"><span>《不方时间》</span></a><span>串台啦！希望这碗鸡汤令您用餐愉快~</span></p><span></span><p><span>往期串台节目直达：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/5ff339bbdee9c1e16d8af32d" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/5ff339bbdee9c1e16d8af32d"><span>实习生活 X 不方时间 | 有偿实习暗网：焦虑、信息差与我们的选择</span></a></p><span></span><h2><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/5f62167a83c34e85dd36c1a8" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/5f62167a83c34e85dd36c1a8"><span>#15 Jiazhen: 跟「不方时间」的主播聊聊实习和播客</span></a></h2><span></span><p><span>-------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>史上“最难”秋招季又来了！从以找正式工作为目标到开始准备到真的找到工作可能要花一年甚至更长的时间，求职-就业的道路上总是”难“字当头，难以预料、难以名状，又或许在多少次尝试中发觉自己的难能可贵。这期节目是三位已经初为职场打工人的复盘局，不仅是回顾那个埋头苦干的自己怎样一路走来，更是在自我审视与追问中，摸索自己要往哪里去。</span></p><span></span><p><span>P.S.本期给大家熬好了N碗浓香鸡汤，暖心暖胃，速来品尝！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="325">00:05:25</a> 聊天发现三人的工作竟是上下游？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="534">00:08:54</a> 要花多长时间去实习？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">00:16:30</a> 在和市场的碰撞中发现自己更适合做的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1240">00:20:40</a> 关于找到适合自己团队的三点经验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">00:28:00</a> 纯文科生如何大转行进入金融行业？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2360">00:39:20</a> 求职会考虑哪些维度？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3140">00:52:20</a> 如果给自己的人生计算ROI</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3325">00:55:25</a> 尝试进入新业务</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3650">01:00:50</a> 如何主动接触自己领域外的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4350">01:12:30</a> 不要给自己设限</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4440">01:14:00</a> 写一个全面的list做复盘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4590">01:16:30</a> “指哪儿打哪儿”式投简历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4710">01:18:30</a> 比do what you like更重要的是like what you do</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4860">01:21:00</a> “世界真的就是个草台班子”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4880">01:21:20</a> 面试前自我催眠：你真的很厉害</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5003">01:23:23</a> 定制化自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5040">01:24:00</a> 如何看待第一份工作的重要性？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5610">01:33:30</a> “我们这代人”的幸与不幸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5690">01:34:50</a> 与大环境和自己去和解</span></p><span></span><p><span>Mentioned:</span></p><span></span><p><span>科技早知道|</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/634fb5282e5853af9bafcfc5?s=eyJ1IjoiNWU3ZGY5MDAxYmZiYmMzZGFkODIwNjVmIn0%3D" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/634fb5282e5853af9bafcfc5?s=eyJ1IjoiNWU3ZGY5MDAxYmZiYmMzZGFkODIwNjVmIn0%3D"><span>前阿里CEO卫哲:趁年轻去印一张自己人生的股票|S6E34硅谷徐老师</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>不方时间|</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6354129c2a992d56e91e64f0" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6354129c2a992d56e91e64f0"><span>vol.95最难秋招众生相，一切都是最好的安排？</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>MC：</span></p><span></span><p><span>屈女士 互联网战略投资分析师</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小e 现就职于四大交易咨询</span></p><span></span><p><span>vv 消费行业券商分析师</span></p><span></span><p><span>编辑：小陈</span></p><span></span><p><span>Music:</span></p><span></span><p><span>The White Coast - Catching Sunset</span></p><span></span><p><span>PASCALS - 晴れるやベイビー</span></p>]]></description>
