  <item>
    <title>职场姐姐｜陈怡静（上）：前领英高管教你如何职场社交</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6504841dbbe351e6160e12ed</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6504841dbbe351e6160e12ed</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 17 Sep 2023 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>怡静是前领英中国的高管和前在行创业团队成员，她的职业一直围绕着“连接人”展开，她也在性质各异的公司中见证了中国互联网的每一步发展。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最初认识怡静是在b站上，她的每一期节目都是对日常职场的一种恰到好处的提点。我们通过b站后台联系上了怡静，终于邀请到了她来做客。</span></p><span></span><p><span>与怡静的对谈将分为上下两期播出，本期我们将与帮助过千万人进行职场社交的她聊聊职场新人该如何Networking。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【Highlights】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="327">05:27</a> 怡静的职场经历：新浪-在行-领英中国</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="592">09:52</a> 职场社交迷思①：只有e人才能做好职场社交吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1234">20:34</a> 职场社交迷思②：心态问题 or 情商问题 or 能力技巧问题？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1581">26:21</a> 职场社交迷思③：大佬/导师工作繁忙、高不可攀，ta愿意帮助我吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2063">34:23</a> 小e的三个职场故事：如何一步步成长为职场社交e人，与老板们做“朋友”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3198">53:18</a> 职场社交迷思④：作为北漂/沪漂/港漂的我们，能在大城市扎根并积累长期人脉和客户资源吗？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【Mentioned】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://b23.tv/k9RX9em" data-url="https://b23.tv/k9RX9em"><span>Bilibili - 陈怡静的客厅</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>怡静做客的部分播客节目 - </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64c1298d99e1e7669e1766f4" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64c1298d99e1e7669e1766f4"><span>温柔一刀</span></a><span> / </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/5fe32ac5dee9c1e16d44ed90" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/5fe32ac5dee9c1e16d44ed90"><span>科技早知道</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>怡静与朋友一起主持的播客节目 - </span><a href="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/5ee745a5418a84a0467e1c39/6504841dbbe351e6160e12ed/www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com" data-url="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/5ee745a5418a84a0467e1c39/6504841dbbe351e6160e12ed/www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com"><span>你别这样</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://b23.tv/UPX1ldb" data-url="https://b23.tv/UPX1ldb"><span>Bilibili - 对谈40岁未婚女高管：不婚不生，职场会更顺利吗？| 没人告诉女性的职场真相</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://b23.tv/CQUy9kE" data-url="https://b23.tv/CQUy9kE"><span>Bilibili - 我开会裁我自己？中年失业后，我决定换个活法</span></a></p>]]></description>
